  "summary": "I’m passionate about solving complex technology challenges — from IT support and troubleshooting to building responsive, high-performance web applications.\n\nSkilled in full stack development, I bring hands-on experience with HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, PHP, SQL, C#, Python, and modern frameworks like Next.js and React. On the backend, I work with Node.js, Express, and database technologies including PostgreSQL and MySQL.\n\nI focus on delivering solutions that combine functionality with exceptional user experience. Whether developing custom web solutions, optimizing UI/UX, or streamlining workflows, my goal is to make technology work seamlessly for the user.\n\nOpen to connecting with software engineers, developers, and IT professionals to share insights in web development, software engineering, and IT support.",
